        <mxCell id="23" value="Step 4 prepares the Outer Key (So):&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• XOR every byte of K₀ with hex 0x5C (different from ipad 0x36!)&lt;br&gt;• Byte 0:  0x4B ⊕ 0x5C = 0x17   |   Zero pad bytes: 0x00 ⊕ 0x5C = 0x5C&lt;br&gt;• Using TWO different constants guarantees Si and So are independent!" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F5F7;strokeColor=#D0D5DD;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E2226;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
